    },
    {
      "id": "song-776",
      "category": "宋词",
      "title": "少年游",
      "subtitle": "阑干十二独凭春",
      "author": "欧阳修",
      "dynasty": "宋",
      "content": "阑干十二独凭春。\n晴碧远连云。\n千里万里，二月三月，行色苦愁人。\n谢家池上，江淹浦畔，吟魄与离魂。\n那堪疏雨滴黄昏。\n更特地、忆王孙。",
      "excerptOf": null,
      "excerptNote": "",
      "inputHash": "ea8919552e405424dbe38ffc7288dfaf0246ddae702063af9ad9015c3c99c85a",
      "estimatedOutput": 734,
      "resultPath": "expansion/working/v2/results/song-776--ea8919552e405424dbe38ffc7288dfaf0246ddae702063af9ad9015c3c99c85a.json"
    },
    {
      "id": "song-777",
      "category": "宋词",
      "title": "桃源忆故人",
      "subtitle": "碧纱影弄东风晓",
      "author": "欧阳修",
      "dynasty": "宋",
      "content": "碧纱影弄东风晓。\n一夜海棠开了。\n枝上数声啼鸟。\n妆点愁多少。\n妒云恨雨腰支袅。\n眉黛不忺重扫。\n薄幸不来春老。\n羞带宜男草。",
      "excerptOf": null,
      "excerptNote": "",
      "inputHash": "2e676928d0a84477b19fad3004a4e11d7dce9f0f1536307cb6349b7e26866640",
      "estimatedOutput": 726,
